{
    "title": "Flags Quiz - Guess The Flag",
    "description": "Welcome to Flags Quiz! The ultimate free trivia game where you guess the flags, maps, capitals, and paint the flags of countries from around the world.\r\n\r\nFeaturing hundreds of levels and thousands of flags, this game promises endless entertainment. Best of all, it's completely free to play!\r\n\r\nDownload now and join millions of players worldwide who are already hooked!\r\n\r\nAs you advance in Flags Quiz! Guess the Flag, new levels and challenges await, testing your knowledge to the limit. In 2024, anticipate an expanded index of flags, including countries, maps, areas, places, and objects from across the globe. This highly addictive and challenging game frequently updates with new levels and flags, ensuring you're always engaged. Test your world knowledge and discover if you can claim the title of geography master.\r\n\r\nIf you're ready for a bigger challenge, invite friends and family to join you and see who can correctly guess the most flags. Flags Quiz! Guess the Flag is ideal for group gatherings or spending quality time with loved ones.\r\n\r\nBut the fun doesn't stop there - this game also has tons of amazing features to keep you engaged and coming back for more:\r\n\r\n\u2605 Paint the flag challenge\r\n\u2605 Easy to play - just type the word you think is in the picture to make your guess.\r\n\u2605 High-quality flags that are challenging but not impossible to guess.\r\n\u2605 Hints - stuck on a level? Use a hint to get a clue and keep the game moving.\r\n\u2605 In-game currency - use coins to purchase hints, lives or unlock special levels.\r\n\u2605 Offline play - no internet? No problem. This game can be played offline.\r\n\u2605 A wide range of difficulty levels, from beginner to expert, to appeal to players of all skill levels.\r\n\u2605 Detailed stats: Track your progress and see how you compare to other players.\r\n\u2605 Multiple lives: Use multiple lives to keep playing even if you make a wrong guess.\r\n\u2605 Daily Lucky Wheel: Log in every day to spin the Lucky Wheel receive special daily rewards and bonuses.\r\n\u2605 Regular updates - with new levels, flags, and features added all the time, there's always something new to discover.\r\n\r\nOne of the best things about Flags Quiz! Guess the Flag is that it's the perfect game to play no matter where you are. Whether you're stuck on a long car ride or waiting for your flight at the airport, this game will keep you entertained for hours on end. And with offline play available, you can even enjoy the game when you don't have an internet connection.\r\n\r\nNot only does the game offer a wide range of difficulty levels, but it also includes a variety of categories to choose from, including capital cities, foods, famous locations, and more. This means that no matter your interests, you'll be able to find flag to guess that you're passionate about.\r\n\r\nBut don't just take our word for it - players around the world are already raving about Flags Quiz! Guess the Flag. From its high-quality flags to its wide range of difficulty levels, this game has something for everyone. In fact, it's consistently ranked as one of the top trivia games in the app store.\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD NOW FOR FREE\r\n\r\nSo why wait? Download Flags Quiz! Guess the Flag today and start enjoying all the fun and excitement this flags quiz trivia game has to offer. And don't forget to invite your friends to play!\r\n\r\nOverall, this game is an absolute blast to play. It's challenging and satisfying, but most of all, it's just plain fun. I can't recommend it enough!\r\n\r\nCompare your answers with your friends!\r\nChallenge them to see who guesses more flags and maps!\r\nTry to paint the flag correctly and test your geography IQ.\r\n\r\nNew features are coming soon.\r\nCheck for the updates!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.prizepoolstudios.com/privacy\r\nTerms of Service:  https://www.prizepoolstudios.com/terms",
